  "items": [
    {
      "source": "a Receiptable for tracking receipts",
      "translation": "用于跟踪收据的 Receiptable",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "An overloaded version of <a href=\"StompSession.html#acknowledge(java.lang.String,boolean)\"><code>StompSession.acknowledge(String, boolean)</code></a> with\nfull <a href=\"StompHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompHeaders</code></a> instead of just a <code>messageId</code>.",
      "translation": "带有完整 <a href=\"StompHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompHeaders</code></a> 而不是仅 <code>messageId</code> 的 <a href=\"StompSession.html#acknowledge(java.lang.String,boolean)\"><code>StompSession.acknowledge(String, boolean)</code></a> 的重载版本。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "An overloaded version of <a href=\"StompSession.html#subscribe(java.lang.String,org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp.StompFrameHandler)\"><code>StompSession.subscribe(String, StompFrameHandler)</code></a>\nwith full <a href=\"StompHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompHeaders</code></a> instead of just a destination.",
      "translation": "重载版本的 `<a href=\"StompSession.html#subscribe(java.lang.String,org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp.StompFrameHandler)\"><code>StompSession.subscribe(String, StompFrameHandler)</code></a>`，使用完整的 `<a href=\"StompHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompHeaders</code></a>` 而非仅目的地。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Send a message to the specified destination, converting the payload to a\n<code>byte[]</code> with the help of a\n<a href=\"../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "向指定的目的地发送消息，借助 <a href=\"../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> 将负载转换为 <code>byte[]</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Variant of <a href=\"StompSession.html#disconnect()\"><code>StompSession.disconnect()</code></a> with headers.",
      "translation": "带有标头的<a href=\"StompSession.html#disconnect()\"><code>StompSession.disconnect()</code></a>变体。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the configured <a href=\"../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回配置的<a href=\"../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Subscribe to the given destination by sending a SUBSCRIBE frame and handle\nreceived messages with the specified <a href=\"StompFrameHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompFrameHandler</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通过发送 SUBSCRIBE 帧订阅给定的目的地，并使用指定的<a href=\"StompFrameHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompFrameHandler</code></a>处理接收到的消息。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>payload</code> - the message payload",
      "translation": "<code>payload</code> - 消息负载",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>handler</code> - the handler for received messages",
      "translation": "<code>handler</code> - 接收消息的处理程序",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>consumed</code> - whether the message was consumed or not",
      "translation": "<code>consumed</code> - 消息是否已被消费",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a handle to use to unsubscribe and/or track receipts",
      "translation": "用于取消订阅和/或跟踪收据的句柄。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> to use this when subscribing you must set the\n<a href=\"StompHeaders.html#setAck(java.lang.String)\"><code>ack</code></a> header to \"client\" or\n\"client-individual\" in order ot use this.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 在订阅时使用此功能，必须将 <a href=\"StompHeaders.html#setAck(java.lang.String)\"><code>ack</code></a> 头设置为 \"client\" 或 \"client-individual\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, <a href=\"../../converter/SimpleMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>SimpleMessageConverter</code></a> is configured.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，已配置了<a href=\"../../converter/SimpleMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>SimpleMessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A receipt header can also be added manually through the overloaded\nmethods that accept <code>StompHeaders</code>.",
      "translation": "收据标头也可以通过接受<code>StompHeaders</code>的重载方法手动添加。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default set to 15,000 (15 seconds).",
      "translation": "默认设置为 15,000（15 秒）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "An overloaded version of <a href=\"StompSession.html#send(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>StompSession.send(String, Object)</code></a> with full\n<a href=\"StompHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompHeaders</code></a> instead of just a destination.",
      "translation": "带有完整 <a href=\"StompHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompHeaders</code></a> 而不是仅目的地的 <a href=\"StompSession.html#send(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>StompSession.send(String, Object)</code></a> 的重载版本。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "An overloaded version of <a href=\"StompSession.html#send(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>StompSession.send(String, Object)</code></a> with full\n<a href=\"StompHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompHeaders</code></a> instead of just a destination. The headers must\ncontain a destination and may also have other headers such as\n\"content-type\" or custom headers for the broker to propagate to\nsubscribers, or broker-specific, non-standard headers.",
      "translation": "包含完整 <a href=\"StompHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompHeaders</code></a> 而非仅目的地的 <a href=\"StompSession.html#send(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>StompSession.send(String, Object)</code></a> 重载版本。标头必须包含目的地，还可以包含其他标头（例如\"content-type\"或自定义标头），以便代理将其传播给订阅者，或者包含代理特定的非标准标头。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> to use to convert the payload of incoming\nand outgoing messages to and from <code>byte[]</code> based on object type, or\nexpected object type, and the \"content-type\" header.",
      "translation": "设置用于将传入和传出消息的负载转换为 `<code>byte[]</code>` 的`<a href=\"../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>`，转换依据是对象类型或预期对象类型以及\"content-type\"标头。",
      "count": 2
    },
